Context: V. Disability Pension for Categories 'B' &amp;

## V. Disability Pension for Categories 'B' &amp;  
- (a) Disability pension would comprise of a service element equal to 50% of the notional pay as on 1-1-2016 plus disability element equal to 30% of the same notional pay, for 100% disability.
- disability element shall be reduced proportionately subject to the provisions of Rule 8 of CCS (EOP) Rules and subject to minimum disability pension of
- (b) For disability less than 100%, ~ 18,000 per month.
